{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e43f05efa8279ca5cadb7464b31d011b8208410704e221a1a304c5b60f247678", "ja": "（今日はまつりとエミリーの撮影だ。\n新しい仕事で、ふたりとも張りきってるな！）", "zh": "（今天茉莉和艾蜜莉要进行拍摄。\n她们俩都为这份新工作卯足了干劲！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "f7add6086525dbbe883df9ba94c7436e98fc81a0726605d86215006fec984641", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nスタッフさんが、ドリンクを持ってきてくれたのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n工作人员拿了饮料给公主。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "f890f46eba76eeaf4eda9228d049788c6def6f3d49e7b0a3cd3e295393d3f130", "ja": "{$P$}さんとエミリーちゃんの分も\nあるので、ここに置いておくのですよ？", "zh": "{$P$}先生和小艾蜜莉都有份，\n就先放在这边喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1003_p", "source_sha256": "821ffd16cbac079ce6977849548dc971fb4592d7c4cb3823ceb23bb394180469", "ja": "まつり、ありがとう。\n悪いな、俺が取りに行かないとだったのに。", "zh": "茉莉，谢谢你。\n真抱歉，原本应该要我去拿的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "bf75d3d572acec5750fd0ad16e5182358188cbdc85bcbc61f6afe04f587c5871", "ja": "{$P$}さんが忙しいのは、\n姫も知ってるのです。気にしないでいいのですよ。", "zh": "公主也知道{$P$}先生工作很忙，\n不用放在心上的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "182170f371eb87f29a8ae5bd1fc7c84795cd5677a3c6289b574959a75b7b6b7d", "ja": "ありがとう、まつり。そういうところは\nさすが、お姉さんだよな。", "zh": "茉莉，谢谢你。\n这么体贴，不愧是当姊姊的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "14e74e88733d5b0859286e97812dbe2f477fab328404a7f5be37f9195410de28", "ja": "ほ？　{$P$}さん、エミリーちゃんと\nまつりは、そーきゅーと！な双子のお姫様なのです。", "zh": "哦？{$P$}先生，\n小艾蜜莉跟茉莉是超～可爱的双胞胎公主的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "7ab1373d4b162ce460207dff1fef2ad28b720d40fb872cb112e4c5813781afc2", "ja": "だからデュオの時は、どちらがお姉さんでも、\n妹でもないのです。ふたりでひとり、なのです。", "zh": "所以双人组的时候，并没有分谁是姊姊谁是妹妹，\n彼此是二位一体的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "09f9b6cc40a44103571ead204653aa3b1be8b6848049dd47160ae3bd3b72e63c", "ja": "結構こだわるんだな……。\nまつり的に、それが大切なポイントなのか？", "zh": "还真讲究呢……\n对茉莉而言，这件事非常重要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "481df310af928c75abcb79edf1845b1302ceb2038c5ea66baec97e86b3af8bb6", "ja": "もちろん！　とっても大切なことなのですよ？", "zh": "当然！这可是非常重要的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "5277af667ff3f8092e8f64a89ad931327395cb1b0058f0b287938dfa859c30a3", "ja": "姫がお姉さんだと、エミリーちゃんは\n遠慮してしまうかもしれないのです。", "zh": "如果公主是姊姊，\n小艾蜜莉就有可能会顾虑公主的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "fb00ebd9fe80d9d486533f8dc72319d0e68b927a1a009ba2a26a2979aca23639", "ja": "でも双子の姉妹なら、お互いさまなのです。\n言いたいことを、ちゃんと言ってもらえるのですよ♪", "zh": "但如果是双胞胎姊妹，彼此就没有高低之分。\n有话就可以直说了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "46e1615f8d60ca1acc9dce7e5fc097804dc09106b6901fbcae3d953e15219d0b", "ja": "なるほど……双子だから対等に、って事か。", "zh": "原来如此……因为是双胞胎，所以是对等的关系呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "1575e1bc6474cabee036359f0619dc381ca6ba320ea4e40b1bb436b4d07ee278", "ja": "そういうことなのです。姫がエミリーちゃんに\n助けてもらっているところも、たくさんあるのです。", "zh": "就是这样的唷。\n公主平时也是受小艾蜜莉不少帮助的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "0a8d2bab1daaea781538ea2408ca9eabd248c40ee3b27a0b6d48dc9317f92504", "ja": "それに姉妹だと、お姉さんは妹にあんまり\n甘えられないのです……しょんぼりなのです。", "zh": "而且如果是姊妹，那当姊姊的\n就不能找妹妹撒娇……好失落的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5d902bd1f82d7cb9e0aeee5ab0c14800bd806e27ffb15ed79bb5cd451bf132e6", "ja": "そうか……考えてみると、人に甘えるっていうのは、\n案外難しい事なのかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊……仔细一想，要跟别人撒娇，\n确实不是件容易的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "c99097b94bed40fcdb2336eb508d85fd73bde3f6e103eb28f38ce431c58aafe0", "ja": "お姉さんだって、たまには甘えたいのです……。\nうるうる、なのです。", "zh": "当姊姊的人，偶尔也是会想撒娇的呀……\n泪眼汪汪的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "16f348f0fac41f8e08bf9a52179a2f8c7e45500333641f53a65857e9097c08f7", "ja": "だから今、まつりはとっても幸せなのです。\nエミリーちゃんがいてくれて……。", "zh": "所以现在，茉莉非常幸福的喔。\n有小艾蜜莉陪在身旁……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "33344164719fad4483c45164bd0ec8cab481ef1a9bb835c054b58091c18e9373", "ja": "それから、{$P$}さんが\nいてくれて。……ふふっ！", "zh": "而且，也有{$P$}先生在……\n呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3fda07177d706fbf04c3322b2116c584ba1659a8495d7ffbda85083dfe12c3da", "ja": "そうか。\nまつりがそう言ってくれるなら、よかった。", "zh": "这样啊。\n我很高兴听到茉莉这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "8498b3c4cc7c7cd7064e2d79ae3412fcbb9ba4e2e5729a9eac1a46c347dd7d5f", "ja": "あっ、そろそろエミリーちゃんの撮影が終わるのです。\nじゃあ姫も、撮影に行ってくるのです。", "zh": "啊，小艾蜜莉差不多要结束拍摄了喔。\n那公主也去拍摄了唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0103_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "37ecc22c64bb86a07730171fe1414c3d5ed9a776e4c7086fb4944f92c83c3210", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n姫のきゅーと！なところ、しっかり見てるのですよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n公主可爱的一面，你要好好看着的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
